  "project_description": "Adds the spoiler functionality to CKEditor 5. The new spoiler plugin is compatible with CKEditor 4 spoiler plugin \n\n How to use \n 1. Navigate to Administration > Extend and enable the module.\n\n2. Navigate to Administration > Configure > Content > Formats.\n\n3. Edit your text format and add Spoiler button to CKEditor toolbar.\n\n4. Enable \"spoiler support\" filter.\n\n5. Save configuration.\n\n Dependencies \n CKEditor 5 - core\n\n Back to top",
